      "severity_ceiling_hint": "High",
      "review_hint": "Chainlink answers are feed-specific decimals (often 8, sometimes 18). Confirm aggregator.decimals() is read (not assumed 8/18) and the answer is normalized before combining with token amounts.",
      "examples": [
